---
---
<section id="porque-elegirnos" class="py-section-padding px-gutter bg-surface border-t border-outline-variant">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">
    <div data-reveal class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-14">
      <p class="font-label-md text-label-sm tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-teal-accent mb-3">Por qué elegirnos</p>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface [text-wrap:balance] max-w-2xl mx-auto">Confianza que se construye caso a caso</h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-px bg-platinum-silver mx-auto mt-5"></div>
      <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-5 [text-wrap:pretty]">
        No prometemos resultados: prometemos trabajo serio, comunicación clara y defensa dedicada.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 md:gap-6">
      <div data-reveal class="whyus-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 md:p-7 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-teal-accent/10 border border-teal-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px] text-teal-accent" aria-hidden="true">handshake</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface leading-tight">Atención Personalizada</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-charcoal-text text-[15px] leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">Trato directo con su abogado. Sin derivaciones ni call center: usted sabe quién lleva su caso y cómo contactarlo.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100" class="whyus-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 md:p-7 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-teal-accent/10 border border-teal-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px] text-teal-accent" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface leading-tight">Experiencia Especializada</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-charcoal-text text-[15px] leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">Enfoque exclusivo en Laboral, Seguridad Social y Penal. Profundidad antes que generalismo.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="200" class="whyus-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 md:p-7 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-teal-accent/10 border border-teal-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px] text-teal-accent" aria-hidden="true">balance</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface leading-tight">Compromiso Ético</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-charcoal-text text-[15px] leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">Transparencia sobre riesgos, costos y tiempos. Información clara para decisiones informadas.</p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="300" class="whyus-card bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 md:p-7 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-teal-accent/10 border border-teal-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px] text-teal-accent" aria-hidden="true">location_on</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface leading-tight">Cercanía Local</h3>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-charcoal-text text-[15px] leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">Firma ipialeña con sede única. Conocemos el contexto regional y atendemos presencialmente en nuestra oficina.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
